C03: the assistant_desire contract admits three sentences and rejects only real acceptance (KNOWLEDGE1529)

KNOWLEDGE1527 measured that the shaped drafts for «¿Querés un café?» and «¿Quieres una pizza?» («No necesito un café… Si tenías en mente algo…, por favor dime») were rejected by the contract: only two sentences were allowed, and «por favor» and «gracias. Si…» (with the punctuation folded away) counted as acceptance. The contract now admits three sentences and rejects only real acceptance («sí, quiero», «me encantaría», «claro que sí»); verified offline against the same model.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


